{
  "_comment": [
    "Q&A linguistic schema. Loaded via Modeling > Q&A setup > Field synonyms, or pasted into",
    "the model's linguistic metadata.",
    "",
    "Why this file exists: Copilot and Q&A are only as good as the vocabulary the model",
    "exposes. Out of the box, a user asking 'which merchants are struggling' gets nothing,",
    "because no field is called 'struggling'. Mapping business language onto model fields is",
    "the difference between a Q&A visual that gets used and one that gets switched off in the",
    "first week. This is the least glamorous part of the AI extension and the part that most",
    "determines whether it survives contact with users."
  ],

  "Version": "1.0",
  "Language": "en-ZA",

